{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_warmy_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_warmy_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"未完的結局","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_warmy_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"e5737967d4279e8f05d0c8e85a2670fd06b2566bf1f0c431d9e624aeca6e0788","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"溫米回到家鄉，與大家庭的成員們看了一場露天電影。故事的結局還未分曉，但她想要畫上句號。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎——啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……還好還好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈕扣店裁縫","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"你還好吧，小溫米？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我沒事！我接到這個盤子啦，還有這個碗，它們都沒有摔壞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，蘿蔔纓子嬸嬸。我剛剛拿到這支法杖，還用不太習慣，常常一不小心，就把在高處的東西弄下來……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩微微踮腳，把掉下來的盤子和碗放回原位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈕扣店裁縫","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，你這孩子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈕扣店裁縫","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得嗎？那個時候你每次要來我家吃瘤奶脆片，都要站在小椅子上，才拿得到櫃子裡的專用小碗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈕扣店裁縫","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"來，讓嬸嬸好好看一下。嗯，真的長高不少了欸……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，溫米也這麼覺得！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈕扣店裁縫","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"……你看，你衣領這裡的縫線都裂開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的耶……旅行這麼久，我都沒有發現……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈕扣店裁縫","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，快去換一套其他的衣服，嬸嬸幫你補一補。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，不用啦，嬸嬸，我自己會弄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我也有自己的小針線包哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈕扣店裁縫","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你這孩子……是不是在外面吃了不少苦頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈕扣店裁縫","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前嬸嬸在信裡不是說，溫米之前住的房間已經有別人搬進來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼覺得……房間裡的擺設都沒有變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈕扣店裁縫","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"你走了以後啊，有幾個年輕人進來住過。但是幾個禮拜前，隔壁鎮上不是有找到新的礦產地嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈕扣店裁縫","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"之前住在這裡的那個孩子啊，就像你之前一樣，只留了短短的一封信，就急急忙忙地離開啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈕扣店裁縫","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，你跟你的胖鐵頭叔叔說好了，今天晚上要住在我這裡嗎？你等一下，嬸嬸馬上就把房間收拾好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用啦，嬸嬸。溫米很快就又要走了啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次回來，我只是想再看一下叔叔跟嬸嬸們，還有爸爸……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈕扣店裁縫","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"噢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈕扣店裁縫","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"最近我沒有聽到你爸爸的消息，但你可以再去附近晃晃，可能會有其他人知道哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一個很重要的事情——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天傍晚，在破廠房的空地上，會放露天電影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嬸嬸也來吧！溫米請大家看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g3_rmbttown"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！你笑什麼啊，溫米絕對沒有騙你哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是真的闖過重重關口，經過一片鮮為人知的沙地獸樂園，才找到巨獸的老巢哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡有超級超級多非常高大的源石結晶……比這些鐵塔吊和鋼煅爐還要高很多欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太棒了，太棒了！大伯相信你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會告訴其他工友叔叔阿姨，小溫米去了很遠很遠的瞪眼谷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是咧嘴谷啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，對，是咧嘴谷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在外面奔波這麼久，我們的小溫米一定學到很多了不起的本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過大伯覺得啊，只要你平安無事，就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以後也要多回來看看我們啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，可是我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，小朋友，我剛才說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是說，你講兩個小故事的時間，我就可以把它修得跟新的一樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快把這個折疊小椅子拿回去給蘿蔔纓子嬸嬸吧！你跟她說，她就算站在上面跳踢踏舞，也絕對踩不壞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！謝謝牙鬍子大伯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？還有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"露天電影……傍晚跟我們一起來看露天電影吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看露天電影？……哈哈，難怪你嬸嬸會叫我修這把折疊小椅子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，大伯答應你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大伯好久沒看電影了。最近放的都是那些冒險故事片，你們年輕人是不是喜歡看那個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不像我們這些老人，比較想看那些節奏慢的家庭片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有啊，溫米也很喜歡看家庭片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……以前，爸爸常常叫我陪他一起看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得，每次到故事的最後，主角的家人跟主角笑著道別的時候，爸爸都會掉眼淚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他明明已經是個大人了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你爸爸啊……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是個重感情的人，我們都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那幾年，我家那小子——就是螺栓哥哥，要去大城市的工程學院上學。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我因為要看著店裡，常常沒空，好幾次那小子要回學校，都是你爸爸順路送他過去的……你還記得嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，溫米記得哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小時候，爸爸每次去上班，都會叫我乖乖留在大伯的店裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他明明已經有跟溫米說他要去礦場，但我還是一直纏著你問說他去哪裡了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，對啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小溫米從小就跟爸爸的感情那麼好，唉……大伯知道，你還是很想他，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說，螺栓哥哥已經順利畢業了，還留在大城市，而且有找到好工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……溫米很高興！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，溫米相信，如果爸爸知道了……他也一定會非常高興的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯……沒錯，你爸爸他會知道的。那傢伙雖然話不多，但他消息總是很靈通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他現在啊，一定在哪個礦場裡擔重任啦……一定是的！希望他那邊打牌的規則跟我們一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我們的小溫米跟爸爸再見面的時候，他一定會很高興的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你要去的那艘很厲害的大礦船，它是要開去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……我也不是很清楚欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘭娜姐和暴行姐跟我說，我要去羅德島上，是為了治……不對，不只是這樣，我是為了去學很多很厲害的技能的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊。答應大伯，好好照顧自己，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯，我會的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程隊瓦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老牙鬍子，喇叭還給你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，接好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……喇叭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈……小溫米還沒有看過長得這麼奇怪的喇叭吧？這就是螺栓哥哥公司研發的新產品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個小子告訴我，它會這麼細長又彎彎的，就是為了可以讓聲音傳到更遠的地方去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然工人們只是用它在鷹架上面隔空聊天……但是，也是不錯啦，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牙鬍子大伯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修理鋪鉗工","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個喇叭，可以借我嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔阿姨們！……咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喇叭）叔叔阿姨們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊……怎麼這麼大聲……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"穿著各式制服的工人們，紛紛順著聲音望向門口。\n他們看見了生鏽的鐵門開了一條窄小的縫，一個小女孩拿著喇叭，探頭出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喇叭）叔叔阿姨們！……今天！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喇叭）今天傍晚，一起來看露天電影吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喇叭）還是在老地方，就在破廠房的空地上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喇叭）還、還有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喇叭）晚餐記得不要吃太飽哦，我會準備小點心給大家！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工廠盤點工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸，今天要放露天電影？還有小點心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工廠品檢員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太棒了，我們剛連夜檢測完這一大批鋼材，剛好休息休息，慶祝一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工廠品檢員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，兄弟們，不要忘了去雜貨店搬幾箱汽水來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工廠採購員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對了，剛才那是誰家的孩子，聲音怎麼這麼響亮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工廠審計員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我記得她……看她那個樣子，應該是已經找到她爸爸了吧？真好啊，真好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工廠搬運工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，原來是她啊……她離開多久了？兩年多？已經過兩年多了啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工廠搬運工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……對啊，兩年多，不就是一轉眼的事嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工廠技術工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，對我們來說的確是一轉眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工廠技術工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是對那孩子來說，兩年的時間，一定很漫長吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"narration","text":"工人們陸續來到破廠房的那片空地上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喇叭）大家！露天電影就快要開始啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喇叭）高的椅要放倒，矮的往前靠，這樣才不會擋住後面的人哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"椅子擺了一排又一排，大部分的人已經坐下來了，只剩幾個人還在挑更喜歡的位置。\n有人跑到屋頂上，有人用挖土機把自己吊起來，還有人最後乾脆跑到螢幕的後面去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":true,"text":"（喇叭）小鍋蓋——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸欸蘭娜姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很討厭欸！喇叭還沒關！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":true,"text":"啊？喇叭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那你的鄉親們是不是都聽到我幫你取的響亮綽號啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":true,"text":"怎麼樣，他們是不是都覺得這個名字很棒啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":true,"text":"喂——喂？聽得到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……溫米再也不想理蘭娜姐了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":true,"text":"好啦好啦，我跟你說對不起！……我只是擔心你嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我們不是說好了嗎，等你和家鄉的大家打完招呼，就回一下訊息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哦對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一忙就忘記了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你這孩子……算了啦，跟大家見面，很開心吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是真的很開心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":true,"text":"哈，好啊。那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"溫米，電影要開始囉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我來啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":true,"text":"快去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":true,"text":"等你把這幾年憋著的話都說完了，明天我們再到小鎮的車站接你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘭娜姐，我今天晚上就可以走了啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是……麻煩你們到那個地方去接我，可以嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"narration","text":"工人們目不轉睛地盯著螢幕。每個人的耳邊都迴盪著故事主角的獨白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“那時，我還不知道他坐上的那輛車會開向哪裡。”\n“曠野微茫無邊，一不小心走散了，就可能一輩子都不會再見面了。”\n“……我所尋找的前路，又在何方呢？”\n“錯過末班車的我，沿著黑漆漆的大路徒步向前走，一直走到天亮。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸……？電影就這樣結束了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，感覺故事還沒有講完啊……主角最後說的那些話，到底是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫米好像沒有看得很懂……不過，大家應該都看得很開心吧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播站書記員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真是個好電影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播站書記員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真羡慕他……能夠只是為了一個想法，就這樣奔走終生，實在是太有勇氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傢俱廠木工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，也就只有電影裡面會這樣，現實生活中哪有這麼不切實際的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傢俱廠木工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得，為什麼導演沒有把他的結局講清楚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傢俱廠木工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這還用說，一個人走進深山，走進幽谷，走到大地的盡頭……那不就是死路一條嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播站書記員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……死路一條？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播站書記員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你這傢伙，怎麼可以這樣說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔……這兩個叔叔好像以前就常常吵來吵去……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（感覺現在的氣氛又不太對了……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播站書記員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"結局拍成這樣，不就是要留給我們想像嗎？你連這都不懂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播站書記員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你的生活經歷導致你只能看到他的死路，那我只好為你感到可惜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傢俱廠木工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我只看到他不負責任。你可能跟他一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傢俱廠木工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是我兒子長大以後也像他一樣，我一定會把他揍到走不出這個礦區！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播站書記員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傢俱廠木工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣？要打架嗎，來啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼突然又打起來啦？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要再打了啦——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圍觀的工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喔！今天的露天電影結束之後竟然還有摔角表演賽啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圍觀的工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，壓住他，不要讓他反擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圍觀的工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快點，把我準備的汽水都發給兄弟們，我們慶祝一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下……不是這樣的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本看完電影之後應該是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"不要在這裡亂來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"呵啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播站書記員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲……我的手臂……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傢俱廠木工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……我的腰……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……叔叔好厲害，居然一下子就打倒兩個！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g13_smallroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你好不容易回來，結果這群人還是一樣長不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒關係啦，我印象中大家一直都是吵吵鬧鬧的……雖然今天好像吵得特別兇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好有胖鐵頭叔叔，一出手就俐落地解決啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是只靠我，你準備好要看完電影吃的小甜點也有功勞啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"溫米，來幫個忙，幫我把錄影帶放回牆旁邊的櫃子裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒事！我只是在看盒子上寫的片長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來今天放的這部電影，真的是完整版啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，原來溫米也不太喜歡電影的結局啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒有，我其實很喜歡哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算結局沒有講清楚……但我覺得，對主角來說，他已經到了終點，可以開始新的旅途啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！這只是我的想法……就算大家吵得不可開交，我也覺得大家的想法都很有道理哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"傻孩子……其他人怎麼想的不重要，重要的是你自己怎麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"溫米為什麼想要請大家看露天電影呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想把大家都聚在一起，就像爸爸之前一樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在每次出遠門之前，他都會和大家一起看一場電影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說，這樣，所有人就都能開開心心的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們的小溫米，是真的長大啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔知道，你想和大家好好道別，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是最後變得太混亂了，我還是沒有找到機會說出口……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"不過啊，其實溫米已經和大家說了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"在你把大家召集來的時候，不是有跟我們講你這兩年來的經歷嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"看到你能照顧好自己，也有認識新的朋友……我們都知道，就像電影裡的主角一樣，小溫米也要踏上新的旅程了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的是，你還很年輕，未來還有很多可能。所以想做什麼，就去做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你是想留在小鎮，還是想要繼續去找爸爸，還是有其他打算……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔嬸嬸們，都會支持你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胖鐵頭叔叔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"傻孩子，謝什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鎮放映員","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"等你下次回來，我們再看一場露天電影，好不好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g5_rmbtwild_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦材運輸員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到了，小朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦材運輸員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到那邊的貨運列車車站了嗎？聽說最後一條到這裡的路線不久前才剛停運。但還好，月台還沒拆掉，燈還亮著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦材運輸員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我還有貨要送，沒辦法繼續陪你了，你自己小心一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝叔叔送我到這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦材運輸員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦材運輸員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"路上磚頭很多，小心一點，不要被絆倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯，嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心，這條路溫米走過很多很多次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我已經不會再跌倒啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g6_rmbtmine"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩停下腳步。\n深不可測的漆黑吞沒了廢棄的鐵軌。被遺忘的礦工帽凹坑顯眼。扭曲變形的閥門手輪散落在地上。\n一盞傾倒的礦燈忽閃、忽閃，也突然失去了光芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我很想你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是……溫米要去很遠的地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蘭娜姐說，我們以後要去的地方會比貨運列車的終點站還遠，比咧嘴谷還遠……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不、不過，不用擔心我哦……因為大家都會等溫米的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩邁過了鬆垮的警戒線，走向廢墟。\n她撫摸著那些沉默而冰冷的石塊，就像撫摸著記憶裡那只寬厚又粗糙的手，她從未想過要鬆開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……再見啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
